  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS-Team Peru 2023 &#x2013; Finance expert</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2023, massive rains, due to the cyclone Yaku, were followed by serious floodings in many parts of Peru.The official request comes from the Deputy Minister of Finance from Peru. It was channelled to the DRR-Team by the Netherlands embassy in Peru.The proposed DRRS-Team should provide Peru with technical advice on short-, medium-, and long-term flood risk management from a multilayer safety approach to reduce the risks and impacts of future floodings caused by El Ni&#xF1;o and La Ni&#xF1;a.</narrative>
  </description>
